            <div class="col-md-12">
              <div class="content-box">
                <h3>Honesty & Integrity</h3>
                <img class="right-image values-image" src="./images/bleeding_heart_250_188.jpg" />
                <p>
                  Being genuine with the people we work with is at the heart of our business. We’re up-front with our clients about budgets, capabilities, expectations, and results. We own our failures and celebrate our successes, all the while bringing integrity, passion, and an ever-growing fountain of knowledge and experience to each and every project.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="content-box">
                <h3>Sustainability</h3>
                <p>
                  The leading cause of biodiversity loss is habitat destruction and degradation. Our landscapes aim to create habitat and forage for birds, pollinators, and other beneficial critters. Your plants will provide a safe haven for life to flourish. You’ll also be mitigating soil loss, reducing runoff, capturing carbon, and lowering your fossil fuel footprint.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="content-box">
                <h3>Commitment</h3>
                <p>
                  A successful garden project is a long-term endeavor, and we are committed to seeing each and every project through to that success state. The installation is not the conclusion, but the start of a journey. We want to be there with each client on their journey, providing support and guidance, helping to ensure their garden not only survives, but thrives.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="content-box">
                <h3>Natural Beauty</h3>
                <img class="right-image values-image" src="./images/shady_urban_250_188.jpg" />
