                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="content-box">
                <h3>Real Human Interaction</h3>
                <p>
                   As so much of the world's interactions go digital, and more of what's produced online is shopped out to Generative AI, we feel it is critically important to stay grounded and connected as human beings. We avoid the use of Generative AI in all of our products and client communications. Our work is our own, and we like it that way, even if it takes a bit more effort.
                </p>
